<title>USA: Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle at standstill - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle at standstill - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was at a standstill in the Panhandle area early Thursday, USDA said. Slaughter steers and heifers not tested. Feedlots reporting light inquiry.</p>
<p>There were 89,700 head confirmed for the week to date which includes 17,200 formulated cattle and 2,800 contracts to be shipped this week.</p>
<p>Confirmed - None</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720--</p>
</text>
